HRTF data: Chromium's composite IRCAM set

Files
  Composite.flac and README, copied unchanged from chromium/chromium at
  09931c1f02320a1b1175af4f338c992c02342f89, path
  third_party/blink/renderer/platform/audio/resources/. Their git blob ids
  there are 209b1747bbc41eb8881346ab8371eda0a46bb1f5 (Composite.flac) and
  f152871abc6bbd057147bd5100c4449e45522d6d (README).
  Composite.flac concatenates the 240 IRC_Composite_C_R0195_T<azimuth>_P<elevation>
  responses as its README describes. threejsc_audio::init() decodes it and
  hands it to the engine's port of Chromium's HRTF panner.

Acknowledgement
  These head-related impulse responses come from the LISTEN HRTF database,
  measured by the Room Acoustics Team of IRCAM (Institut de Recherche et
  Coordination Acoustique/Musique), Olivier Warusfel, in the LISTEN project
  with AKG. http://recherche.ircam.fr/equipes/salles/listen/

