  Chromium and WebKit ship these files without a separate license. WebKit added
  the individual responses in r74433 (https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=50998)
  and rebuilt the concatenated file in r132993
  (https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=98294). Neither records how the
  composite set was derived from the LISTEN subjects.

  The repository's operator chose on 2026-11-12 to ship this set on the terms
  above, the same footing on which web-audio-api-rs ships LISTEN subject 1003.
